/E (I would like to express my sincere appreciation to my supervisor, Mr. Cheng Yen Ming Manager of Operations, for his invaluable assistance, wealth of information, helpful comments and guidance to me throughout the industrial training period. I was encouraged every day by his continual encouragement. Of course, a special mention goes to Mr. Puvendran a/l Sangaran who is the Chief Executive Officer of CTOS Basis, the executive operations team, researchers, assistants, and the operation analysts, particularly Rishmin, Nurin, Nurul Syazwani, Aemiliya, and Shamilah for offering me the required advice, guidance, and warm hospitality during the practical training. I can't thank all the staff at CTOS Basis enough for making me feel like I was a very welcome, comfortable person on the premises, as an intern.)
/Pg 14 0 R
