/E (The company's identity is declared and background is given.CTOS Basis Sdn. Bhd. is a special purpose business to business B2B service provider and is a wholly owned subsidiary of CTOS Digital Berhad. The company is based in Menara CelcomDigi in Petaling Jaya, Selangor, and is a key player in the financial ecosystem, providing global commercial credit information, comprehensive company profiling and localised risk analytics.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
281 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 159 0 R
/E (CTOS Basis specializes in providing financial institutions, multinational corporations and small and medium enterprises \(SMEs\) with trading risk assessment, counterparty exposure monitoring and safe credit decision making services in Malaysia and Singapore. CTOS dominates the domestic credit reporting market with more than 70% of the market share, and has amassed a huge database of information about approximately 15 million consumers and 8 million business entities.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
