/E (International Expansion Revenue saw 17.5% growth, contributing to a significant RM46.1 million in the brand's international business sector, where it is selling credit data and scoring solutions in Indonesia and the Philippines.  Financial Outlook, Revenue levels are still at record levels, but profit margins are coming under strain as large investments in technology are continuously being made, together with investments in the cloud and the processing of legacy data manually.)
/Pg 18 0 R
