396 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 164 0 R
/E (I did a number of database entity verifications to ensure the integrity of the master database. When I got a new corporate profile or search request, I needed to go through our system's database and see if the company was already in our database or not. It included cross-referencing the names of the companies as they existed in the past, the historic addresses and the company registration numbers .)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
