398 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 164 0 R
/E (I was also instructed to examine public court records and flag and document any active court cases, judgments and charges against any corporate entity and/or sitting members of their Board of Directors. This is important because litigation frequently is the first indicator of financial trouble or an impending operating default.)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
