400 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 164 0 R
/E (The journey at CTOS Basis was an incredible learning opportunity and a great opportunity to make a connection between learning and industry. Under Ms Ming's guidance, I refined my analytical skills, built a keen eye for detail, and honed my pressure cooking skills when it comes to complex corporate profiles and bulk data requests. Plus, working closely with operations analysts, researchers and management gave me a firsthand look at how a large corporate credit bureau operates, which was an invaluable basic introduction to a finance and data analytics-based career.)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [7]
>>
