410 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 165 0 R
/E (The First CTOS Pickleball BattleThe first social event I can recall while I was in training was the first-ever CTOS Pickleball Battle at The Kitch'n Club in Kota Damansara. This was a very special corporate tournament involving 48 entries split up into 24 doubles teams from all areas of the company.To play on court with staff and compete against other departments was a great team building and friendly competition exercise. It was an incredibly energetic atmosphere, with intense rallies and lots of laughter, as colleagues from different departments cheered each other on. Though we didn't get in the top three \(we were beaten by the winning teams Bola Goreng, C1 and Supering, it was a great learning experience about how to work together as a team and a way to build my internal network by meeting a lot of new people throughout the company.)
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
