/P 165 0 R
/E (Cultural Festivities: Hari Raya Celebration & Connect Townhall.I also got to enjoy myself with the CTOS office's Hari Raya Celebration which was right at their office. This was an outstanding display of Malaysian hospitality and inclusiveness in the workplace. Having a day away from the database pipelines was very rewarding, and we celebrated with the whole department, enjoying many of the traditional Hari Raya foods.The event was co-located with the Raya Meraya Celebration Townhall and part of a larger series of Townhalls and Awards called CTOS Connect. I was able to observe the company's motivation and support culture firsthand during the town hall by witnessing the many internal awards they give to their top employees.)
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
