/E (Market Leadership )
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
460 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 168 0 R
/E (CTOS Basis is the market leader in commercial credit risk and business intelligence and has the majority of market share for corporate verification in the B2B space in Malaysia. Its absolute strength is the strong institutional linkage it has with high ticket clients, including multinational companies \(MNCs\), large trade credit insurers \(like Allianz Trade or Coface\), large exporters and blue-chip commercial firms. These organizations rely on CTOS Basis to do the critical pre-delivery underwriting of whether a corporate buyer or new supply chain vendor is financially healthy enough to manage payment terms of 30, 60 or 90 days. This results in a very high switching cost and in an extremely sticky revenue stream as corporate credit policies, and procurement rules are explicitly based on CTOS Basis data structures like the 6Cs credit evaluation framework \(Character, Capital, Capacity, Condition, Credibility, Control\). Completely rewriting the corporate risk manuals, retraining procurement staff and risk losing historical risk benchmarks would be required to replace CTOS Basis. Moreover, CTOS Basis credit check APIs are directly integrated into the Enterprise Resource Planning \(ERP\) systems of large B2B companies. When the system is integrated, it runs on auto-pilot and transaction volume is very predictable, while business credit checks are a legal requirement in the standard process of corporate compliance audits and therefore protect CTOS Basis from economic downturns.)
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
