/E (Large Pool Data )
/Pg 27 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
470 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 169 0 R
/E (The absolute core competitive advantage that gives CTOS Basis a competitive edge over technology startups and international competitors is its massive international and local commercial database of more than 8 million companies and business profiles. This is a very diverse data pool, which cannot be replicated in a single night and combines official regulatory data with proprietary B2B data. This data moat is based on clean and historic data from the Companies Commission of Malaysia \(SSM\), capital structure, shareholders and directorship networks. It's stuffed with millions of historical court filings, bankruptcy proceedings and winding-up petitions over the years, and it also includes exclusive electronic Trade References \(eTR\) which provide real-world payment data from local suppliers. Also, CTOS Basis facilitates local clients to have instant access to business credit reports from over 80 countries through founding membership in the business credit reporting networks such as Asiagate and the Credit Alliance. The depth of the data pool is the only factor determining the accuracy of predictions in a B2B credit analysis. The risk ratings and commercial risk classifications provided for CTOS Basis are extremely accurate, as the company has decades of connected corporate history, which a new market entrant could not develop from scratch.)
/Pg 27 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
