532 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 174 0 R
/E (The volume of international corporate and cross-border B2B intelligence.The amount of information available regarding foreign companies and inter-country B2B.CTOS Basis could benefit immensely from expanding its international business report division, as it has a large opportunity to grow its revenue beyond the already established market in Malaysia. With the advent of a very Globalized trade system, local exporters as well multinational companies and international supply chain managers are seeking more and more deep credit background checks of the foreign buyers and partners. CTOS Basis is able to get credit intelligence in real-time across over 80 countries through its active memberships in top-tier networks, such as Asiagate and the Credit Alliance. This move puts the company in a position to respond to the growing need for cross-border risk management and make CTOS Basis a key tool in global trade, helping companies to manage foreign bad debt risks.)
/Pg 32 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
533 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
