/E (This is an automated system that can be accessed by these foreign investors who are based in various cities including New York, London or Tokyo, and they don't have to wait for the CTOS office to open after hours to access the bond data in Malaysia. This allows foreign buyers to quickly and conveniently determine whether or not a corporate bond is a safe investment prior to investing millions of dollars in it. Moreover, this will provide CTOS with a significant edge, as other credit bureaus continue to use outdated manual methods to transfer their data. With this modern digital bridge, CTOS is able to easily charge these international investors a monthly subscription fee, thus allowing them to enjoy a successful regular income stream with no financial risk.)
