603 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 180 0 R
/E (The engineering division should build encrypted, zero-knowledge data auditing nodes that preserve user privacy while maintaining full regulatory compliance \(Skywork Enterprise, 2026\).  The expanding scope of Malaysia's Personal Data Protection Act \(PDPA\), which tightly regulates the handling of personal identity metrics belonging to corporate directors, shareholders, and sole proprietors, is one of the constantly changing regulatory environments that CTOS Basis' commercial reporting division must deal with. Deep credit screening and stringent consumer data privacy regulations frequently cause a structural contradiction in standard legacy data environments, requiring the business to pay high legal compliance expenses to confirm the legality of the data. )
/Pg 38 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
604 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 180 0 R
/E (By enabling the platform's analytical engine to statistically confirm a director's credit risk, legal connections, or bankruptcy history without actually retaining or copying raw, unencrypted personal data, the deployment of encrypted, zero-knowledge auditing nodes addresses this vulnerability. By putting in place this privacy-focused backend platform, CTOS Basis is protected from the operational risk of significant data breaches or legal penalties, and internal audit times are accelerated. By guaranteeing complete systemic compliance with changing regulatory laws and maintaining quick and secure report deliveries for enterprise subscribers, this establishes the company as an unparalleled leader in digital trust. )
/Pg 38 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
