/P 181 0 R
/E (Finally this industrial training at CTOS Basis Sdn. Bhd. has been one of the best learning experiences of my educational life. During the weeks internship, I got the opportunity to bridge the gap between what I learned in theory at Universiti Teknologi MARA \(UiTM\) and what I had in real working environment within the company. I gained an appreciation for accuracy, integrity, confidentiality and efficiency when managing financial and corporate information which is the basis for business decision making as an Operations Assistance Intern.)
/Pg 39 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
615 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 181 0 R
/E (During my internship, I had a number of tasks assigned to me including: corporate data requests in bulk, database verification, legal and compliance checks of the financial statements, and processing of business credit information. These activities helped me build my technical expertise in financial analysis, analytical and problem solving abilities, and communication, teamwork and time management. In addition, I gained knowledge and understanding of organizational culture, leadership and professional ethics through corporate activities and communicating with other department staff.  )
/Pg 39 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
616 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 181 0 R
/E (The SWOT analysis in this report reveals that CTOS Basis enjoys significant competitive strengths, most notably in its strong market leadership, wide commercial database and solid reputation in the credit reporting industry. But the company also has several internal and external challenges such as a growing number of competitors, manual data processing, the changing data privacy regulations, and cost of operations. For CTOS Basis to stay competitive in the dynamic business landscape, they need to keep investing in digital transformation, automation technologies, cloud-based infrastructure, artificial intelligence, and in the development of innovative data analytics products for the B2B sector. The company should also enhance regulatory compliance, seek strategic collaborations with various parties such as RAM Holdings to access new debt and bond markets, and increase its footprint in ASEAN markets.)
/Pg 39 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
617 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 181 0 R
/E (Overall, this internship has been great for my personal and career development and has provided me with much exposure to the industry. It has enhanced my self-esteem, my understanding of financial information management and business operation, and prepared me for future employment opportunities in the corporate risk management, business intelligence and finance fields. I can say that I am very grateful to the opportunity given by CTOS Basis and Universiti Teknologi MARA \(UiTM\) as it has built my ground for future learning and future career success plus I learned some useful knowledge and relevant skills for the workplace.)
/Pg 39 0 R
/K [7]
>>
